{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0251_story_area03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0251_story_area03_title", "source_sha256": "5978ab6511e5086ee18bb379f89b2d8af8f2bc98ed8684b9e7e931c42bad1604", "ja": "姫路城大解剖ツアー！", "zh": "姬路城大解剖之旅！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0251_story_area03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0251_story_area03_synopsis", "source_sha256": "fb2db12a3494de8cfd722c0b7289112df3cb08599e840dc7796f95903fa51435", "ja": "ツアーの合間に、姫路城を観光する亜美、\n静香、紬。観光を楽しむ静香と紬に対し、\nパンフレットを熟読する亜美。\nお城に仕掛けられた罠を劇場にもと言う\n亜美に、不安を抱くプロデューサーだった。", "zh": "巡演间隙，亚美、静香和紬一起游览姬路城。  \n静香和紬享受着观光的乐趣，亚美却认真地研读着宣传册。  \n听到亚美说要把城里设置的陷阱也搬到剧场来，制作人不禁感到不安。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0251_story_area03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0251_story_area03_1000_p", "source_sha256": "a3f428d39c025f25598e239cdfa808988920230e1892a416bb06745e3ad16672", "ja": "（ツアーの仕事がない今日は、姫路城観光へ。\nアイドル達に、思いっきり羽を伸ばしてもらおう！）", "zh": "（今天没有巡演的工作，去参观姬路城吧。让偶像们尽情放松一下！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0251_story_area03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0251_story_area03_1001_015siz", "source_sha256": "533a5b47b377f6ffb2e34d57bac14daef023065d1deab9892280e61fbb2dfbf5", "ja": "さすがは、姫路城ですね！\n白鷺城っていう綺麗な別名がぴったりです。", "zh": "不愧是姬路城！\n“白鹭城”这个美丽的别名真是再合适不过了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0251_story_area03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0251_story_area03_1002_051tmg", "source_sha256": "e9a681afadb6bbc63f87d963519e3f5be28f219075ac035557377f960c7e788c", "ja": "こちらのお城は、エピソードの多さも魅力ですね。\n宮本武蔵に刑部姫、播州皿屋敷なども……。", "zh": "这座城堡的传说也非常丰富，是它的一大魅力。\n像宫本武藏、刑部姬，还有播州皿屋敷……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0251_story_area03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0251_story_area03_1003_p", "source_sha256": "e45bdad789c4f9c58924f7b6e2e11d660b82eb79ee21f07ef38672960d780399", "ja": "ふたりとも、よく調べてきたんだな。", "zh": "你们两个都好好调查过了啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0251_story_area03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0251_story_area03_1004_015siz", "source_sha256": "e2ada318b422877863614d47a3e6d55d4a7a0ec08f3fb26b040b861bdd8961b5", "ja": "来ることがわかっているなら、事前に調べるくらい\n当然のことです。礼儀ですよ、礼儀。", "zh": "既然知道要来，提前调查一番是理所当然的。这是礼仪，礼仪。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0251_story_area03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0251_story_area03_1005_051tmg", "source_sha256": "64ce817e0e6baf9f87651339a5c4e14b540984ce31f25745d20d3e48f799287b", "ja": "まさかあなたは、私が下調べもせず観光地を訪れる、\n礼儀知らずだとでも……？", "zh": "难道在您眼里，我竟然是个连事先了解都不做就跑去观光景点的、\n不知礼数的人……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0251_story_area03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0251_story_area03_1006_p", "source_sha256": "7d8d20c832eb77531ad5d5533318904fa994d9a107f16a2f8fda63e55d99759f", "ja": "い、いや、そんなつもりは……。", "zh": "不、不是，我不是那个意思……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0251_story_area03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0251_story_area03_1007_015siz", "source_sha256": "6151aa9218154c1cb69f255c71e5080a95b094f7cc855d67328e9498e72db01f", "ja": "ほら、見てください。亜美だって、あんなに熱心に\nパンフレットを熟読してるじゃないですか。", "zh": "您看，亚美不也正那么认真地研读宣传册吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0251_story_area03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0251_story_area03_1008_p", "source_sha256": "325c7e316a1d0eafdd6e57c87c15a175d927f901541c02bf17185c7a56b4fc38", "ja": "え？　亜美が、お城に興味を……？", "zh": "咦？亚美对城堡感兴趣……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0251_story_area03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0251_story_area03_1009_011ami", "source_sha256": "ccf03ee1f20849900fc6e55f26867b7ef6acf9d73721f444c2ea2eeb039addbf", "ja": "うん！　だって、天井から槍が降る門とか、\n城の奥に進んでるのに下る坂とか……。", "zh": "嗯！因为有那种会从天花板降下长枪的门，还有明明在往城堡深处走，却会向下倾斜的坡……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0251_story_area03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0251_story_area03_1010_011ami", "source_sha256": "25e338951da0d34392be2b5efcf4e32a04d8421cf678c89b634c231bf6224a10", "ja": "めっちゃ面白そうじゃん！？　いいな～。\n亜美たちの劇場も、こんな風にならないかな～。", "zh": "看起来超级有意思嘛！？真好啊～  \n要是亚美她们的剧场也能变成这样就好了～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0251_story_area03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0251_story_area03_1011_051tmg", "source_sha256": "b80da56d3f6f1ab751e3c3983ab2c70381463565b4c50cd7d23e3fb9408c64b8", "ja": "確かに姫路城は、その防衛性、機能性も\n高く評価されていますが……。", "zh": "姬路城确实在防御性和功能性方面也备受好评……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0251_story_area03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0251_story_area03_1012_015siz", "source_sha256": "806a9825cea48b275276e0098d2a71803fc0268fb5908d7446b880e4a87df7a5", "ja": "そういう理由だったのね……。なんにせよ、\n意欲が芽生えていいことなのかも……？", "zh": "原来是因为这个理由啊……不管怎么说，能萌生干劲或许也是件好事……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0251_story_area03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0251_story_area03_1013_011ami", "source_sha256": "bf072f34d05e7926b94d3aaa10bf0068f663dfa76a8c92c2c77030ad693fbd0f", "ja": "ほらほら、みんななにしてんの！\n姫路城大解剖ツアーに、いざ出陣ー！", "zh": "快快，大家还在干什么呢！\n姬路城深度探索之旅，现在出发——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0251_story_area03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0251_story_area03_1014_p", "source_sha256": "fa5bd4b902fcf925e14c7a9bdd5576c8282357803419305147c8114865270370", "ja": "（みんな、興味を持って姫路城を楽しんでくれた！\nただ劇場の改造に関しては注意しておかないとな……）", "zh": "（大家都对姬路城产生了兴趣，玩得很开心！不过剧场改造的事，还是得提醒他们注意啊……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
